OL,3,AUK government approves Jackdaw gas
OL,4,Afield and says production will start
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch backs
OL,8,Fthe decision, but accuses the
OL,9,Fgovernment of "faffing about"; the
OL,10,FGreens call it "climate vandalism"
OL,12,FJackdaw was approved by the
OL,13,FConservatives in 2022, but was delayed
OL,14,Fby legal challenges - here's a brief
OL,15,Fhistory and here's a reminder of UK and
OL,16,FScottish net zero targets
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/41
