OL,3,AAberfan holds minute's silence to mark
OL,4,A60 years since coal tip collapsed,
OL,5,Akilling 116 children and 28 adults
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn what was the last day of school
OL,8,Fbefore half term, children were
OL,9,Fsettling down to lessons when tragedy
OL,10,Fstruck
OL,12,FEmergency services, miners and people
OL,13,Fwho rushed to the village began an
OL,14,Faround-the-clock battle to dig out
OL,15,Fthose trapped by the debris
OL,17,FKing Charles, Queen Camilla and the
OL,18,FPrince of Wales will then join
OL,19,Fsurvivors, bereaved parents and other
OL,20,Fmembers of the community
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/41
